## Access-Control Requirement
The system manages the review of advertising creatives before an advertising campaign is allowed to launch.

The people involved are advertisers, account managers, brand safety reviewers, and campaign directors. One person may hold both the account manager and the campaign director role at the same time.

The resources are campaigns and creatives. Every campaign records its advertiser, who prepared it, its budget, its contingency amount, its budget tier, its risk labels, its scheduled start, and its status. Every creative records the campaign it belongs to, who submitted it, its risk rating, its content tags, and its status.

