Neither a quality inspector nor a metrology manager may approve the return to service of an asset whose calibration they personally performed.

A run through the workflow by a calibration technician who performs a calibration from a clean-room station and whose asset is then returned to service on the plant network by a different person, tripping none of the prohibitions above, must be able to succeed.

