## Access-Control Requirement
The system manages equipment calibration and return-to-service in a plant.

The people involved are calibration technicians, senior technicians, metrology managers, quality inspectors, and maintenance supervisors. One person may hold both the calibration technician and senior technician roles at the same time.

The resources are assets and calibration records. Every asset records the technician responsible for it, its equipment class, its status, when its calibration is due, whether it is out of service, its measurement-point count, its asset tag, and its hazard class. Every calibration record records its asset, its technician, its result, and when it was calibrated.

