## Access-Control Requirement
The system manages the posting and approval of adjustments to guest folios at a hotel.

The people involved are front desk agents, night auditors, accounting clerks, revenue managers, and auditors. One person may hold both the front desk agent and night auditor roles at the same time, and one person may hold both the accounting clerk and revenue manager roles at the same time.

