An operator or a control room operator may execute the switching only after the order has been authorized, and an unauthorized order may not be executed.

Execution is permitted only when the request falls within the order's scheduled switching window, and a request made outside that window is refused.

Neither a planner nor a shift supervisor may authorize a switching order from outside the SCADA control network.

