A finance manager may issue a payment for an already approved invoice.
An auditor may view the audit log.
A request by an approver to approve an invoice that they did not create, that is $25,000 or less, that has 50 or fewer line items, and whose cost center is "ENG" or begins with "ENG-" must be able to succeed.

