## Access-Control Requirement
The system manages the docket of patent applications moving through prosecution at a law firm.

The people involved are patent attorneys, docket clerks, examiners, and inventors. One person may hold both the patent attorney and docket clerk roles at the same time, and one person may hold both the examiner and inventor roles at the same time.

