Neither a picker nor a forklift operator may pick an order that has not been released.

None of a picker, a forklift operator, or a zone supervisor may access a zone whose sensitivity level exceeds their badge clearance level.

A run through the workflow by a picker who picks a released order and then accesses a zone within their clearance, tripping no prohibition above, must be able to succeed.

